<urn:anqr:delivery-facet:qrdecodingrealimageevidence> <urn:usf:predicate:facetStatement> "The executed qrdecodingrealimageevidence conformance subtest supplies the exact valid-PNG bytes declared by the approved fixture package directly to decode and observes a success result with the exact declared UTF-8 payload. It supplies the declared non-QR PNG directly and observes the named no_qr_found result with no payload. Helpers, injected payloads, mocks, skips, conditional passes, or assertions that do not execute decode cannot discharge this facet. The procedure performs no network, camera, URL retrieval, destination resolution, or payment operation. The test must assert success === true for the valid PNG even while the current implementation fails; keep that failure visible until implementation is repaired. Returning the expected payload without decoding the QR pixels, hard-coded fixture lookup, supplied DecodeArtifacts, or helper round-trips cannot pass. Fixture data: {\"positive\":{\"name\":\"valid-qr.png\",\"kind\":\"qr-code-png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"bytes\":412,\"sha256\":\"sha256:b63d902bf21e57eb19f63a8b854bed2dcec8de871374735f20c676800ed981c4\",\"base64\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"width\":296,\"height\":296},\"expected\":{\"result\":\"success\",\"payload\":\"ANQR QR fixture 2026-09-06\"}},\"negative\":{\"name\":\"non-qr.png\",\"kind\":\"non-qr-png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"bytes\":431,\"sha256\":\"sha256:6901dcfc779eccaa78a45efd5643473202d3119ae5a7d0e5d6825272edd4142e\",\"base64\":\"\",\"dimensions\":{\"width\":296,\"height\":296},\"expected\":{\"result\":\"named-no_qr_found\",\"payload\":null}},\"independentVerification\":{\"decoder\":\"@zxing/library 0.23.0\",\"source\":\"https://registry.npmjs.org/@zxing/library/-/library-0.23.0.tgz\",\"tarballSha256\":\"sha256:e49f1076d9af70179c9fbb5026cda67e48864f3bced64fff548237208cc2ff32\",\"license\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"procedure\":\"Decode RGB pixels from each PNG with QRCodeReader plus HybridBinarizer. Valid fixture returned the expected UTF-8 payload; blank fixture threw NotFoundException.\",\"result\":{\"valid\":\"ANQR QR fixture 2026-09-06\",\"nonQr\":\"NotFoundException\"},\"boundary\":\"The verification package was downloaded to a temporary directory only. It is not proposed as an ANQR dependency or implementation choice.\"}}" <urn:anqr:graph:qrdecoding-real-image-evidence> .
